    /\ ch_alloc_beg ch0 + ch_rz ch0 = ch_user_beg ch0 /\ ch_user_beg ch0 + round_up (ch_used ch0) 8 <= hi0 /\ 16 <= ch_rz ch0 /\ 1 <= ch_used ch0.
  Proof.
