    pose proof (chunk_geomQ s XC XB OKQ ch0 H0) as (G1 & G2 & G3 & G4 & _). subst lo0 hi0. repeat split; try assumption; lia.
  Qed.
  Lemma record_bandQ : aapp lo0 (hi0 - lo0).
